{"strongs": "H8605", "word": "תְּפִלָּה", "translit": "te.phil.lah", "root": "פלך", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "prayer", "definition": "תְּפִלָּה 77 noun feminine prayer ; — ׳ ת Isa 1:15 +, construct תְּפִּלַּת Ps 80:5 +; suffix תְּפלָּתִי Ps 4:2 +, etc.; plural תְּפִלּוֺת Ps 72:20 — 1. a. prayer , 1Kgs 8:38 = 2Chr 6:29 ; Isa 1:15 ; Ps 35:13 ; Ps 80:5 +. \\ \\ b. pray a prayer , ׳ ת ׳ הִתְפ 2Sam 7:27 ; 1Kgs 8:54 (compare v 1Kgs 8:28 v 1Kgs 8:29 = 2Chr 6:19 ; 2Chr 6:20 ); ׳ דִּבֶּר בַּתּ Dan 9:21 specifically of intercession, ׳ נשׂא ת , with בְּעַד in behalf of 2Kgs 19:4 = Isa 37:4 ; Jer 7:16 ; Jer 11:14 . \\ \\ c. אֶלאֱֿלֹהִים ׳ ת 2Chr 33:18 , לְאֵל Ps 42:9 , compare Ps 69:14 with verb + לפני Ps 88:3 ; Ps 141:2 תְּקַדְּמֶ֑ךָּ ׳ תּ Ps 88:14 . \\ \\ d. ׳ בית ת Isa 56:7 (twice in verse) house of prayer (temple); with verb + ׳ אֶליֿ + אלהֿיכל Jonah 2:8 with verb + למעון קדשׁו 2Chr 30:27 . \\ \\ e. hear prayer ׳ שׁמע (אֶתֿ) ת 1Kgs 8:45 ; 1Kgs 8:49 = 2Chr 6:35 ; 2Chr 6:39 ; 1Kgs 9:3 ; Ps 4:2 ; Ps 39:13 + 9 t.; ׳ שׁמע אֶלתֿ 1Kgs 8:28 ; 1Kgs 8:29 = 2Chr 6:19 ; 2Chr 6:20 ; Neh 1:6 ; Dan 9:17 ׳ פנהאל ת 1Kgs 8:28 = 2Chr 6:19 ; Ps 102:18 ׳ אָזְנֶיךָ קַשֻּׁבוֺת לת 2Chr 6:40 ; 2Chr 7:15 , compare Neh 1:11 ( אֶל ), הַקְשִׁיבָה ׳ ת Ps 61:2 ׳ הִקְשִׁיבּ בְּקוֺל ת Ps 66:19 ׳ הַאֲזִינָה ת Ps 17:1 ; Ps 55:2 ; Ps 86:6 ׳ לקח ת Ps 6:10 compare Ps 66:20 ; Ps 102:18 b. 2. in Psalm-titles, poetic, liturgical prayer Ps 17:1 ; Ps 86:1 ; Ps 90:1 ; Ps 102:1 ; Ps 142:1 ; Hab 3:1 of Davidic Psalter, תפלות דוד Ps 72:20 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6655')\">BDB6655</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8605')\">H8605</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6654')\">BDB6654</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6656')\">BDB6656</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>תְּפִלָּה</bdbheb><sub>77</sub> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>prayer</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 1:15\" b=\"23\" cBeg